<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="rich-text-data"><a class="link" href="#rich-text-data">RichTextData</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Rich-text result provided by <code>@enonic/react-components</code> and re-exported by the adapter.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>processedHtml</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>HTML containing reference markers for links, images, and macros.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>links</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>LinkData[]</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Resolved internal content and media links.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>images</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>ImageData[]</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Resolved images and image styles.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>macros</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#macro-data">MacroData</a>`[]`</p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Resolved macro descriptors and configurations.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><em>additional properties</em></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>unknown</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Additional fields carried by an extended rich-text query.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="macro-data"><a class="link" href="#macro-data">MacroData</a></h3>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>ref</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Reference matching the macro marker in <code>processedHtml</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>name</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Macro name.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>descriptor</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Application-qualified macro descriptor.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>config</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>Record&lt;string, Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;&gt;</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Macro configuration grouped by sanitized macro name.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="region-tree"><a class="link" href="#region-tree">RegionTree</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>A record keyed by region name. Each value contains that region&#8217;s <code>name</code> and ordered <code>components: PageComponent[]</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="fetch-content-result"><a class="link" href="#fetch-content-result">FetchContentResult</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Shared input to <code>MainView</code>, <code>BaseContent</code>, and <code>SingleComponent</code>. It is returned by <code>fetchContent()</code>.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>data</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>Record&lt;string, any&gt;</code> or <code>null</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Processed content-type query result.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>common</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>Record&lt;string, any&gt;</code> or <code>null</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Processed shared-query result.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>meta</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="common.ahtml#meta-data">MetaData</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Runtime request and editing context.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>page</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#page-component">PageComponent</a> or <code>null</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Normalized page component tree.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>error</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>{code: string, message: string}</code> or <code>null</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Structured fetch failure inherited from <code>Result</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
