<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="constants"><a class="link" href="#constants">Constants</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="macro_disable"><a class="link" href="#macro_disable">MACRO_DISABLE</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>system:disable</code> — descriptor used for XP&#8217;s disabled macro.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="macro_embed"><a class="link" href="#macro_embed">MACRO_EMBED</a></h3>
